编辑配置上下文功能
1:点击按钮:先判断是否有设置上下文的权限
resources/modeler/configuration/pandoServices/getPandOAccessInformation?tenant=OnPremise
请求参数
{
    "version": "1.0",
    "commandList": [
        "GetAttachedModels",
        "AttachModels",
        "DetachModels"
    ]
}
响应
{
    "GetAttachedModels": "Granted",
    "AttachModels": "Granted",
    "DetachModels": "Granted",
    "version": "1.0"
}
GetAttachedModels、AttachModels、DetachModels 都为Granted就继续往下调用接口
