点击+号，显示搜索框，点击搜索框调用的接口，如果输入了文字需要进行文字的匹配
federated/search?xrequestedwith=xmlhttprequest&tenant=OnPremise
注意:https://3dsearch.r2026.v6.com/   是这个请求地址，项目中已经有怎么获取到3dsearch 的网址
请求参数: D5D205296E1600006A1BE4F3000121EC 这个是当前页面展示的Model，
单个Model的请求参数如下
 "query": "(flattenedtaxonomies:\"types/Model\")AND  ( NOT current:\"Inactive\") AND ( NOT current: \"Obsolete\")  NOT (physicalid:D5D205296E1600006A1BE4F3000121EC)",

如果有多个Model是以下的参数
query:"(flattenedtaxonomies:\"types/Model\")AND  ( NOT current:\"Inactive\") AND ( NOT current: \"Obsolete\")  NOT (physicalid:D5D205295D8B000069BA3C4900000098)NOT (physicalid:D5D205296E1600006A1BE4F3000121EC)"

如果Model为空的的请求参数
"query": "(flattenedtaxonomies:\"types/Model\")AND  ( NOT current:\"Inactive\") AND ( NOT current: \"Obsolete\")   OR (flattenedtaxonomies:\"types/Products\")AND  ( NOT current:\"Inactive\") AND ( NOT current: \"Obsolete\")  ",

如果输入框里面输入了值的请求参数如下，如果有Model需要加上Model的请求参数
    "query": "( (flattenedtaxonomies:\"types/Model\")AND  ( NOT current:\"Inactive\") AND ( NOT current: \"Obsolete\")   OR (flattenedtaxonomies:\"types/Products\")AND  ( NOT current:\"Inactive\") AND ( NOT current: \"Obsolete\")   ) AND (([ds6w:label]:(ddd)) OR ([ds6w:label]:(*ddd*)) OR ([name]:(ddd)) OR ([name]:(*ddd*)))",

如果为空的情况下
    "query": "(flattenedtaxonomies:\"types/Model\")AND  ( NOT current:\"Inactive\") AND ( NOT current: \"Obsolete\")   OR (flattenedtaxonomies:\"types/Products\")AND  ( NOT current:\"Inactive\") AND ( NOT current: \"Obsolete\")  ",

